 "address": "Hoofdweg 578-720 / Postjeskade side, De Baarsjes: 2008 perimeter block in pale buff brick; on Hoofdweg seven storeys of wide multi-light windows with staggered and stacked deep cantilevered balconies behind frosted glass rails over a continuous shop plinth, ribbon windows under a high parapet on the north end, and in the courtyard deep wide loggias with brick parapets over a storey of paired windows and the ground-floor front doors (kit batch 2005+, lane kit-batch-2005-20261121)",
